  "title": "Norwegian Potato Klub",
  "description": "Norwegian Klub is a potato dumpling dish that is easy to make and can be customized in many ways. These are great as leftovers — just fry and enjoy.",
  "authors": [
    "THOMAS ELLEFSON"
  ],
